  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 508.07 Appeal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 508.07 Appeal.\n\n(a) Within 30 days of the date of the written department decision issued pursuant to Env-Wq 508.06(b), any person aggrieved by the decision may appeal the decision as a permitting decision as specified in RSA 21-O:14.\n\n(b) If no petition for appeal is filed within the specified period, the decision shall be final upon the expiration of that period.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1-#3 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 500) #10984, eff 12-1-15; ss by #13511, eff 12-20-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq500.html"
